"It has its icon and its words, so it does not depend on colour. Every "
"field macro writes it and ties it to the control."
msgstr ""
"Tiene su icono y sus palabras, así que no depende del color. Cada macro "
"de campo lo escribe y lo vincula al control."

msgid ""
"It uses Tailwind's own colours, which this base removes, so some colours "
"differ from the published example."
msgstr ""
"Usa los colores propios de Tailwind, que esta base elimina, así que "
"algunos colores difieren del ejemplo publicado."

